WEBVTT

00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:30.222
And so, I initiated peace talks
with the rebels.

00:03:30.898 --> 00:03:36.257
I organized the first multiparty
democratic elections in nearly 30 years.

00:03:36.794 --> 00:03:42.120
(Applause)

00:03:42.902 --> 00:03:44.830
I handed over power

00:03:44.854 --> 00:03:46.975
to the newly elected president,

00:03:46.999 --> 00:03:49.067
I retired from the army,

00:03:49.091 --> 00:03:52.677
and I left my country
for the United States of America

00:03:52.701 --> 00:03:54.089
to study --

00:03:54.113 --> 00:03:56.096
all in three months.

00:03:56.523 --> 00:03:59.849
(Applause)